  <revision rev="6" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>dffccb559008f2451094594313bdcc23</srcmd5>
    <version>0.29.0</version>
    <time>1775065870</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.29.0:
  * Add l18n handling for Decimal field #1466
  * Fix LogoutSerializer for JWT/dj_rest_auth #1392
  * fix: support token blacklist feature in rest_auth [Bart van
    Andel]
  * [django-filter] Add null_label if set in ChoiceFilter (#1450)
    [Enric Pou]
  * fix: camelize tuples/fixed length array (#1432) [Chris
    Wesseling]
  * Fix items:False case in enum hook #1432
  * Add option to overwrite serializer description #1463
  * Fix OpenApiViewExtension not providing view instance under
    self.target (#1405) [astro-stan]
  * Move list default fix to source of the problem #1436
  * Improve confusing doc #1461
  * Add assert to pagination test #1459
  * fix SafeString handling for picky CDumper
  * Remove EOL 3.7 from suite; pydantic not updated for &lt;=3.8
  * Fix DecimalField with decimal_places and max_digits equal.
    [keter2002]
  * fix test for i18n changes on DRF
  * Improve to_filter_name support for django_filter [Matwey V.
    Kornilov]
  * fixes prefix estimation on windows [Luis Nell]
  * Fix default for array types [Stanislav Khlud]
  * fix: use CSafeDumper for render yaml if available [florian]
  * fix: sort list to produce same hash [florian]
  * Add typing.Generic to default lib_doc_excludes [Max Howald]
  * Add get_doc test for class that inherits from Generic [Max
    Howald]</comment>
    <requestid>1343778</requestid>
  </revision>
  <revision rev="7" vrev="1">
    <srcmd5>0fda04300e636c9e0067950bdc584bde</srcmd5>
    <version>0.30.0</version>
    <time>1787324390</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>- update to 0.30.0:
  * Add OAS 3.2 schema for validation &amp; test
  * Type hint build_bearer_security_scheme_object (#1509)
    [johnthagen]
  * Fix formatted CharField allow_blank handling (#1511, (#1499))
    [Luciano de la Iglesia]
  * Consider allOf anyOf with nullable on OAS3.1 #1480
  * Proper handling for OAS 3.2
  * fix modification of user-provided schematas #1500
  * relax contraint on oneOf null case with OAS3.1 #1480
  * Add blueprint for django-rest-knox (#1506) [johnthagen]
  * Mitigate GeneratedField lost arguments and special case for
    DecimalField #1166
  * Webhook explicit operationId
  * change conflicting license field for 3.8
  * Document django-rest-knox support [johnthagen]
  * add help text to spectacular management command arguments
    #1175 [Jean-Baptiste Braun]
  * Mark FileField as nullable in response when not required
    #1493 [mojtaba sohrabi]
  * Extend Choices hint fix with generated label description
    #1486
  * Suppress py&lt;=3.14 deprecation warning #1497
  * Remove ancient DRF3.11 and Django2.2 due to contrib packages
    failing
  * feat: add support for django 6.0 and and drf 3.17 [Vjeran
    Grozdanic]
  * Add setting to disable docstring extraction [Phil Starkey]
  * feat: add support for polymorphic built-in drf support
    [Benedikt Bauer]</comment>
    <requestid>1372747</requestid>
  </revision>
</revisionlist>
